OL,3,GNEWSA'We were without internet for
OL,4,Aweeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a Surrey village have
OL,7,Fexpressed anger after they were hit by
OL,8,Fa prolonged broadband outage.
OL,10,FJill, from Frensham, said it was "very
OL,11,Fscary" when the internet "suddenly
OL,12,Fdisappeared" on 5 September as her
OL,13,Fhusband's heart monitor needs
OL,14,Fconnectivity.
OL,16,F"The most important thing for me is to
OL,17,Fmake sure that the hospital knows
OL,18,Fwhat's happening with his body so they
OL,19,Fcan keep an eye on him," she said.
