OL,3,GNEWSA'We were without internet for
OL,4,Aweeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Openreach spokesperson has
OL,7,Fapologised for the loss of service,
OL,8,Fwhich it blamed on a burst water pipe
OL,9,Fdamaging underground cables.
